        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PNR150SMTS4, 1-1/2\" Diameter Pioneer Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSo named because it is a pioneer in today's design trends, the Stainless Steel Pioneer Door Pull has a modern look that makes it perfect for almost any home or commercial space. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. The Pioneer Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. Choose from polished or brushed stainless steel finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-foot-long-stainless-steel-pioneer-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150048smts4\"><b>48\" Stainless Steel  Pioneer Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/brass-pioneer-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150smtsbr\"><b>Brass Pioneer Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PNR150SMTS4 Pioneer Collection Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PNR02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262242\"><b>First Impressions PNR150SMTS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PNR150018SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.68\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PNR150024SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.68\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PNR150036SMTS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.68\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 8 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Pioneer Door Pull",
                "description": "So named because it is a pioneer in today's design trends, the Stainless Steel Pioneer Door Pull has a modern look that makes it perfect for almost any home or commercial space. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass or metal doors. The Pioneer Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. Choose from polished or brushed stainless steel finishes. \r\n",
                "keywords": "FII-10x-US32x First Impressions Model #10 Door Pulls, FII-S10x Contemporary Stainless Door Pulls, Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull,  Large Bar Door Pulls, 24 inch door pulls, contemporary Large Door Pulls, contemporary door pulls, First Impressions Model #10A Stainless  Door Pulls,  FII-PNR02, Stainless Steel Pioneer Door Pulls, First Impressions PNR02, Pioneer Collection series 2 door pulls, 1-1/2 Diameter Pioneer Brass Door Pulls, FII-PNR150SMTS4, First Impressions PNR150SMTS4"
